***************************************************************************
                     DiGits History File, v1.31
***************************************************************************

==== v1.31 ====

    - Bug Fix Update: September 27, 1997
    - If a player selected a highlighted ROW, but then hit their ENTER key
      instead of selecting a COLUMN, they were given an Arithmetic Conversion
      Error, which exited out of the program. (Thanks to Ken Bauder for both
      reporting and FINDING this bug!)

==== v1.30 ====

    - Updated and cleaned for use with CNet, v4.28d.
    - Newer error checking routine.
    - v1.20 never released.

==== v1.1 ====

    - Fixed a small bug that allowed the player to select a highlighted
      square that did not have a number in it. This resulted in the human
      player actually skipping a turn and the Amiga getting an extra turn.

==== v1.0 ====

    - First release version.
    - Halloween, October 31, 1992.
    - From an original idea by Stephane Edwardson

**************************************************************************
                        END OF HISTORY FILE
**************************************************************************
